    "text": "Let P be a presentation of a finite group G on mp generators and rp relations.\nThe deficiency def (G) is the maximum of mp − rp over all presentations P . Let G\nbe a finite group such that G = G′ ̸= 1 and the multiplicator M (G) = 1. Prove that\ndef (Gn ) → −∞ as n → ∞, where Gn is the nth direct power of G.          J. Wiegold",
